{"id":"n1-103","title":"Noun を境にして","romaji":"Noun wo sakai ni shite","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Means 'as a turning point', 'since (time)', or 'from (time) on'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point 'Noun を境にして' is used to indicate a significant change or turning point marked by a specific event or time. It means that after this boundary, some situation changes or a new state begins.","formation":"Noun + を境に(して)","examples":[{"jp":"父の死を境にして、彼の性格が一変した。","romaji":"Chichi no shi wo sakai ni shite, kare no seikaku ga ippen shita.","en":"His personality changed completely since his father's death.","words":[{"surface":"父","vocabId":"1497610","reading":"ちち"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"死","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"境","vocabId":"1235950","reading":"さかい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼の","vocabId":"1000420","reading":"かれの"},{"surface":"性格","vocabId":"1375290","reading":"せいかく"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一変","vocabId":"1166420","reading":"いっぺん"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5]},{"jp":"試験を境にして、休暇を取る予定です。","romaji":"Shiken wo sakai ni shite, kyuka wo toru yotei desu.","en":"I plan to take a vacation after the exam.","words":[{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"境","vocabId":"1235950","reading":"さかい"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"休暇","vocabId":"1227610","reading":"きゅうか"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"取る","vocabId":"1326980","reading":"とる"},{"surface":"予定","vocabId":"1543240","reading":"よてい"},{"surface":"です","vocabId